{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1003_p", "source_sha256": "92da33b18e7e266d36ec5015828740be824130245435794d5eb169f4a5b64a7c", "ja": "お疲れさま、可奈……おっ、衣装似合ってるな！\nそれで、今回の映画の事なんだけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，可奈……哦，服装很适合你耶！\n对了，关于这次的电影……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "261506041fbe9bf4ca52c2e01a012425c455024caa78f54f474ab5ed55725bac", "ja": "ぐすっ……うぅ、ぐす……。\nあ、{$P$}さん……？", "zh": "呜呜……呜呜、呜呜……\n啊，{$P$}先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f8f2aba806aa7053706e3ecb7fee13e5dc18a62b2c4ec2ad06ac1de38407b34c", "ja": "か、可奈！？　どうしたんだ！　それは……\n『魅裏怨』の台本？　やっぱり怖くて……？", "zh": "可、可奈！？你怎么了！那是……\n《魅里怨》的剧本？你果然很害怕吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "8184115563d88305357032d2254fb0e9c0e28a23ff9004c6199cdd4965b10818", "ja": "えっ？　……あ、ち、違うんです！\nそうじゃなくて、この台本……。", "zh": "咦？……啊，不、不是的！\n不是你想的那样，这个剧本……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "cb1f1d1910673b2b070e93888b3b8fd8b79ceadb4c24b8b6f6898c5509d65810", "ja": "こ、怖いお話だって聞いてたから。\nひとりで台本を読むのが怖くて、それで……。", "zh": "我、我听说是恐怖故事，\n所以不敢一个人读剧本，于是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "c92b589329c5ae2e6b67190360357a0710a3b3bb05318c50d448f7b4f039988f", "ja": "美奈子さんたちにお願いして、一緒に読んだんです。\nそうしたら……怖いけど、すっごくいい話でした！", "zh": "我拜托美奈子她们跟我一起读，\n结果……虽然很恐怖，但其实是很棒的故事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "22873c016749eccfabd889d3a9391e6b00d897aeaae928ed7c813f654ce88f73", "ja": "そうか、みんなと一緒に……。\nちゃんと最後まで読んだんだな。えらいぞ、可奈！", "zh": "原来如此，跟大家一起读……\n所以你全部读完了啊？真了不起，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "38d8af8c76432a10960a74f94d284a80901858115b49d9b20e5155c43472acc6", "ja": "はい！　ぷっぷかさんと一緒に歌を歌うところとか、\n私、感動して何回も読み返しちゃいました！", "zh": "是啊！跟噗、噗卡小姐一起唱歌的场景让我好感动，\n反复读了好几次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "978c320ee4428bab36678a38c0d498e881796ccb77db053ce9ea37d3852408c3", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nやっぱり歌には、すごい力があるんですね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n歌声果然很有力量呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "d48bd33bb0eb2fe2239ab1af75d1d73275bc685761caafb19c4ed43e33af91dc", "ja": "でもでも、ちょっと心配なんです。\nこんな素敵な役、可奈にできるのかな～？　な～？", "zh": "不过不过，我有点担心。\n这么棒的角色，可奈诠释得了吗～？可以吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1013_p", "source_sha256": "61727f9281699d469469a16f9b80cf80a1a6d81c103df708f164d5af21eb41b0", "ja": "可奈？", "zh": "可奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "7cb05d17c0600e125ee7ac7be862585426c2cc0743bb2d39d798a8d323aeffbc", "ja": "だって私、歌でぷっぷかさんと合奏するんですよね？\n千早さんみたいに歌が上手ならいいですけど……。", "zh": "因为我会和噗、噗卡小姐合奏，没错吧？\n如果我像千早一样会唱歌就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "5aa29b897b3bc8ea591164c7ea5f55f1442f070ca97b3ec79dba144119f39ee9", "ja": "歌で本当の姿に目覚めさせる、なんて。\nそんなすごいこと、私にできるのかなぁ……。", "zh": "用歌声唤醒真正的模样，\n这么厉害的事情，我办得到吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_1016", "source_sha256": "0fbd4ee41a48ec2bfdb1cf21a016137568596a7c0215f3dcbb19ccfd07772862", "ja": "できる！", "zh": "办得到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_2000_p", "source_sha256": "7bc0d5c60a2b2222720d478fa3cff120e9cdd92a2019ed5ab8668642dcad9a06", "ja": "もちろん、できるよ。可奈の歌は楽器みたいに、\n聞いている人を楽しい気持ちにさせてくれるからな。", "zh": "当然办得到呀，因为你的歌声就像乐器，\n可以让听到的人变得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_2001_p", "source_sha256": "9b2f2a4aec45d3fb71850ef2ae715f6218eaf459097c087d37e49eb98c101f05", "ja": "きっとぷっぷかさんも楽しくなって、\n起きてくれるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "噗、噗卡小姐一定也是听了很开心，\n才醒过来的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_2002_036kan", "source_sha256": "60ac5c875aecadf1e144f40bbcc62e1b42bf5881903a9b51728109aefc8350a8", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか！？\nえへ、えへへへへ……♪", "zh": "真、真的吗！？\n嘿嘿、嘿嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_2003_036kan", "source_sha256": "981f97b78added669d45eaf2bfc3d4e780b99756e1a2b9ba7af7a944b5505ce1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！\n可奈、すっごくうれしいかな～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你！\n可奈好开心喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_2004_036kan", "source_sha256": "05ce5a1ec1ed62781640c54e74b767253ea0cc99668682a4a92567793f8cb0ed", "ja": "歌を歌って可奈がハッピ～♪\nみんなもハッピ～♪　ハッピッピ～♪　えへ♪", "zh": "唱着歌的可奈好Happy～♪\n大家也Happy～♪Happyppy～♪嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_2005_p", "source_sha256": "3c950b873f7f8431a52170e527b81fc1d972673da91d8ebc73528d5944548c8c", "ja": "（その後の撮影は、ホラー映画を撮っている現場とは\n思えないぐらい、明るい笑顔と歌声で溢れていた）", "zh": "（后来拍摄现场充满明亮的笑容与歌声，\n简直让人无法联想到这是在拍恐怖电影。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0163_2006_p", "source_sha256": "04eb08947896830289d78e4d2583a934bb58f25ce0a49b57f58b74ed28601c1a", "ja": "（可奈の歌声は、みんなを楽しい気持ちにしてくれる。\nそれは可奈が、誰よりも歌を好きだからだな）", "zh": "（可奈的歌声可以让大家开心，\n这也许是因为她比任何人都喜欢唱歌的缘故吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
